P875A02: answer AKS selector 8 and keep the display on when asked.

SpringBoard retries selector 8 (no outputs) on every setup pass; SpringBoard
also powers the panel off through IOMFB method 12 because the skip-setup image
has no idle-timer preferences. Return success for 8, and with
P875A02fb_keepon=1 ignore power-off requests.

--- a/iokit/Kernel/arm/P875A02KeyStore.cpp
+++ b/iokit/Kernel/arm/P875A02KeyStore.cpp
@@ -299,6 +299,9 @@
 		args->scalarOutputCount = 1;
 		break;
 	}
+	case 8:         /* seen from SpringBoard on iOS 16.7; no outputs */
+		ret = kIOReturnSuccess;
+		break;
 	case kAKSGetLockState:
 		if (out_scalars < 1) {
 			ret = kIOReturnBadArgument;
--- a/iokit/Kernel/arm/P875A02Framebuffer.cpp
+++ b/iokit/Kernel/arm/P875A02Framebuffer.cpp
